{"translation":{"id":"fra_jnd","name":"Bible J.N. Darby","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=frajnd","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"JND","englishName":"French: Bible J.N. Darby","language":"fra","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"121a3f4841e42965f22ebebcf5a8578a12578ec30eaf1ca7ae4e46d5d85ccb80","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31170,"languageName":"français","languageEnglishName":"French"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"fra_jnd","name":"Les Psaumes","commonName":"Les Psaumes","title":"Les Psaumes","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"4c48a766d24644f7ef347ae1395ef8ddb5d363cc30acf1733162d22f071b120e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2527},"chapter":{"number":93,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"*L’Éternel règne, il s’est revêtu de majesté ; l’Éternel s’est revêtu, il s’est ceint de force : aussi le monde est affermi, il ne sera pas ébranlé.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ton trône est établi dès longtemps ; tu es dès l’éternité.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Les fleuves ont élevé, ô Éternel ! les fleuves ont élevé leur voix, les fleuves ont élevé leurs flots mugissants.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"L’Éternel, dans les lieux hauts, est plus puissant que la voix des grosses eaux, que les puissantes vagues de la mer.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tes témoignages sont très sûrs. La sainteté sied à ta maison, ô Éternel ! pour de longs jours.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/93.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/94.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/fra_jnd/PSA/92.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}